itcher, fix payment isolation\n\n- Add EditProfile page for editing name, email, and password\n- Move theme switcher to topbar left of user avatar\n- Scope all payment form selects, filters, and raw queries to\n  current tenant; add getEloquentQuery guard for defence-in-depth", "created_at": "2026-02-20T15:49:18Z", "repo": "amantrainvoice", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ef1a649ba13c7630dbc2a3569c05f5a71f326f32", "message": "Update robots.txt", "created_at": "2026-02-20T08:33:25Z", "repo": "amantrainvoice", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0dabec1aa1bc0c3bd9bab3b9440af6efd249a408", "message": "Merge pull request #6 from ketutardika/develop\n\nDevelop", "created_at": "2026-02-20T08:30:06Z", "repo": "amantrainvoice", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ea7aa6774bdee077e638a210f71a46a4cfdd6735", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2026-02-20T08:27:46Z", "repo": "amantrainvoice", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8c61e698e9821c37943e2b96675473a5d9645462", "message": "add: added basic SEO for landing page\n\ndescription \u2014 search-engine-friendly summary\nkeywords \u2014 relevant invoice/invoicing terms\nrobots: index, follow \u2014 allows crawling and indexing\nauthor \u2014 pulls from APP_NAME\ncanonical \u2014 prevents duplicate content issues (/ and /docs respectively)", "created_at": "2026-02-20T08:27:15Z", "repo": "amantrainvoice", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6c7ac7573e43545c493348d3f5a0d48b8f194b59", "message": "Merge pull request #5 from ketutardika/develop\n\nDevelop", "created_at": "2026-02-20T06:43:48Z", "repo": "amantrainvoice", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d54cd5d902a18f6674ba02008fceb97e2f01a945", "message": "Add live demo link and screenshot to README\n\n- Add live demo link pointing to instantinvoice.cloud\n- Add demo screenshot image below the project description", "created_at": "2026-02-20T06:42:49Z", "repo": "amantrainvoice", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a1ea6c36bba90d2d985919bda9108bab844997b2", "message": "Add public landing page, docs page, and dashboard docs link\n\n- Replace default Laravel welcome page with a full marketing landing\n  page (hero, features, how-it-works, pricing, CTA) using Tailwind CDN\n- Add /docs route with a 9-step user documentation page styled to match\n  the landing page (sticky sidebar, step cards, tables, callout boxes)\n- Register a \"Documentation\" navigation item in the Filament admin\n  sidebar linking to /docs in a new tab\n- Update / route to serve the landing page; add /login redirect route\n  to preserve Laravel's named login route for auth middleware\n- Replace all hardcoded app name strings with config('app.name')", "created_at": "2026-02-20T06:33:34Z", "repo": "amantrainvoice", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4e23e470c8a3c2d08a877fc9d57003ccf5cf88c9", "message": "Fix 500 error on PDF generation caused by unloaded company relation\n\n- Eagerly load 'company' relationship in all three PDF controllers\n  (InvoiceController, ViewInvoice, PublicInvoiceController) so the\n  relation is resolved before DomPDF rendering begins\n- Use null-safe operator (?->) on company->name in pdf.blade.php to\n  prevent fatal errors if the relation resolves to null for any reason\n- Previously the company was lazy-loaded inside the DomPDF try/catch\n  block, causing any null-access error to be swallowed and re-thrown\n  as a generic 500 \"PDF Generation Failed\" response", "created_at": "2026-02-20T03:53:41Z", "repo": "amantrainvoice", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "bca045d26e80d38bafb69fb6df4189181945c302", "message": "Merge pull request #4 from ketutardika/develop\n\nDevelop", "created_at": "2026-02-20T03:10:06Z", "repo": "amantrainvoice", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9b2d5697fe1fe7ddbc2bdaeb29f903d4309bca6d", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2026-02-20T03:09:33Z", "repo": "amantrainvoice", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "abe087ff5c0830e87ef30de7f8bb0cdcb1a98eac", "message": "Use raw numeric values for monetary fields in CSV/XLSX exports\n\n- Replace number_format() with (float) cast on all amount/price fields\n  across ClientsExport, InvoicesExport, ProjectsExport, and PaymentsExport\n- Removes thousand separators so values are importable as real numbers\n  in Excel and Google Sheets\n- Progress % column in ProjectsExport also outputs a plain float instead\n  of a string with % suffix", "created_at": "2026-02-20T03:07:37Z", "repo": "amantrainvoice", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "062b353d486e3f698c5aed94b9b744b1d6fbcdc1", "message": "Add CSV/XLSX export and standardize PDF/export filenames\n\n- Add export feature (CSV & XLSX) for Clients, Invoices, Projects, and\n  Payments via a new ExportController and maatwebsite/excel Export classes\n- Add \"Export\" dropdown header action to all four Filament resource tables\n- Standardize export and PDF filenames to:\n  {app-host}-export-{model}-{company-slug}-{datetime}.{ext}\n  {app-host}-export-invoice-{company-slug}-{invoice-number}={datetime}.pdf\n- Update PDF browser tab title to:\n  {Company Name} - Invoice {number} - {app-host}\n- Use parse_url(config('app.url')) so filenames and titles reflect the\n  configured APP_URL with no hardcoded domain", "created_at": "2026-02-20T02:44:24Z", "repo": "amantrainvoice", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "430f7caa0a5d0b5c448f25428d166cb52f4ad8fb", "message": "Add QR code to invoice PDF for quick client access\n\nInstall simplesoftwareio/simple-qrcode (backed by bacon/bacon-qr-code)\nto generate a scannable QR code on invoice PDFs. The QR encodes a\nsigned public URL so clients can view and pay without authentication.\n\nRendered as a GD-based PNG (no Imagick required) and embedded as\nbase64 inline \u2014 compatible with DomPDF's isRemoteEnabled: false\nrestriction. QR is placed at the bottom center of the PDF, above\nthe footer.", "created_at": "2026-02-20T01:59:15Z", "repo": "amantrainvoice", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "244e96f80caca67764daf63643db8b69bcd29a8f", "message": "Create 2026_02_19_142903_update_projects_status_enum.php", "created_at": "2026-02-19T06:30:10Z", "repo": "amantrainvoice", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3cb0917780da5e2c5d7e91dc0ad72b173a11e237", "message": "Update ProjectResource.php", "created_at": "2026-02-19T06:25:47Z", "repo": "amantrainvoice", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "158bd11e22da10063bb2172c46a780ef5a5dbfa9", "message": "Update Dashboard.php", "created_at": "2026-02-19T06:02:57Z", "repo": "amantrainvoice", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "de2e162853d082724c2069276bc1d553601474ad", "message": "Update pdf.blade.php", "created_at": "2026-02-19T05:07:46Z", "repo": "amantrainvoice", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "086697b42d37144b980f20f3a6e28035a053cd33", "message": "Update pdf.blade.php", "created_at": "2026-02-19T05:06:33Z", "repo": "amantrainvoice", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c42f05594495b9c65957c8aa32d31e999c712a3d", "message": "Fix: Added a third argument to each ->relationship() call \u2014 a query callback that filters by company_id of the current tenant", "created_at": "2026-02-19T05:03:20Z", "repo": "amantrainvoice", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3ad9a9e82b59ebb44e44f5bb9029ebfc1d0cb0e7", "message": "feat: custom login class, named login route, dashboard subheading update\n\n- Register a custom Login page class (App\\Filament\\Pages\\Auth\\Login) in the\n  admin panel provider, enabling future login page customization\n- Name the root redirect route 'login' to prevent RouteNotFoundException\n  when unauthenticated users hit non-Filament auth middleware\n- Update dashboard subheading to a more descriptive tagline", "created_at": "2026-02-19T04:57:19Z", "repo": "amantrainvoice", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6ce16b2232c77db1c1b366e0927908a9f2500133", "message": "Update pdf.blade.php", "created_at": "2026-02-19T02:43:16Z", "repo": "amantrainvoice", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1a61535e08bde7ec8c602331115695f88d142cc0", "message": "Update pdf.blade.php", "created_at": "2026-02-19T02:41:26Z", "repo": "amantrainvoice", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "af32df5a3685caa964ecf21d68bb47db23dcef5b", "message": "Update pdf.blade.php", "created_at": "2026-02-19T02:32:39Z", "repo": "amantrainvoice", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d8390f62d5b7d076f46e4f5f1531004e0f16a1b2", "message": "Update PublicInvoiceController.php", "created_at": "2026-02-18T05:21:26Z", "repo": "amantrainvoice", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "04e73319af642dbd313bed718f29a5de8f4ca2e9", "message": "feat: secure public invoice URL with UUID token and signed routes\n\nReplace invoice number in the public PDF URL with an opaque UUID\npublic_token to prevent invoice enumeration and avoid URL breakage\nfrom slash characters in custom invoice number formats.\n\n- Add public_token UUID column to invoices table with unique index;\n  back-fill all existing invoices automatically in the migration\n- Auto-generate UUID public_token on every new invoice via model boot\n- Update public route parameter from {invoiceNumber} to {publicToken}\n- Update PublicInvoiceController to look up invoice by public_token\n- Update both View PDF buttons (table action + invoice detail page)\n  to generate signed URLs using public_token instead of invoice_number\n\nFinal URL format: /invoices/{slug}/{uuid}/pdf?signature=...", "created_at": "2026-02-18T05:11:26Z", "repo": "amantrainvoice", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4dddb03e3ca13ab482d7d7ae6cd1efb9cecc6b9c", "message": "fix: update View PDF buttons to use new public invoice URL\n\nBoth \"View PDF\" actions in InvoiceResource (table row action) and\nViewInvoice page (header action) now route to the public URL format\n/invoices/{company-slug}/{invoice-number}/pdf instead of the old\nauth-protected /invoices/{id}/pdf route.", "created_at": "2026-02-18T04:35:09Z", "repo": "amantrainvoice", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0f2dc8b93a5faed7bdf99a34933723c24ea3f07a", "message": "feat: public invoice URL, company branding, and profile editing\n\n- Add public invoice route /invoices/{tenant}/{invoice-number}/pdf\n  accessible without authentication; auto-marks invoice as 'viewed'\n  when a client opens it\n\n- Add company logo upload and tagline field to Invoice Settings;\n  PDF template now renders logo dynamically from storage with fallback\n  to default; all InvoiceSettings::getValue() calls are now properly\n  scoped by company_id\n\n- Add EditCompanyProfile page (extends EditTenantProfile) so users\n  can edit company name, email, phone, city, country, and address\n  from the tenant switcher dropdown in the admin panel", "created_at": "2026-02-18T02:55:13Z", "repo": "amantrainvoice", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "75ce2d28d922196f3363606d9af8957dd1590105", "message": "fix: redirect to /admin after login instead of missing /home route\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-02-17T14:27:39Z", "repo": "amantrainvoice", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5267fdf9c03c32802efc0f88e6a05e7197e3c9d7", "message": "fix:app.css", "created_at": "2026-02-17T08:14:14Z", "repo": "amantrainvoice", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f48818eb4e43293f714b1ddfb5fcbd24aec15202", "message": "feat: add multi-tenant SaaS support with company-based data isolation\n\nImplement Filament 3 built-in tenancy using Company model. Users\nself-register, create a company, and manage isolated data (clients,\ninvoices, payments, projects, taxes, settings).\n\n- Add Company model, BelongsToCompany trait, and 3 new migrations\n- Add company_id to all tenant-scoped tables with composite unique constraints\n- Implement RegisterCompany tenant registration page with default seeding\n- Update User model with HasTenants/FilamentUser interfaces\n- Scope all widgets, settings pages, and controllers by tenant\n- Add ownership checks on PDF generation routes\n- Fix pre-existing duplicate column migrations for taxes table\n- Update seeders for multi-tenant data seeding", "created_at": "2026-02-17T07:31:28Z", "repo": "amantrainvoice", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c053e1491291247d414a41691bb36737bbc03c8d", "message": "Merge pull request #3 from ketutardika/develop\n\nfix: resolve input race condition on invoice item fields", "created_at": "2026-02-17T02:39:01Z", "repo": "amantrainvoice", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "60e5d172c8319df450515671ddfe64eacc186d9d", "message": "fix: resolve input race condition on invoice item fields\n\nChange quantity and unit_price fields from live() to live(onBlur: true) to prevent Livewire requests on every keystroke from overwriting fast-typed values.", "created_at": "2026-02-17T02:32:46Z", "repo": "amantrainvoice", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2e7f5d7f8bd1e404935ee988cd60824bf449749d", "message": "Merge pull request #2 from ketutardika/develop\n\nUpdate README.md", "created_at": "2026-01-05T02:34:04Z", "repo": "amantrainvoice", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f747d0b0975ea9649a191e8392e4182f850c6b6a", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2026-01-05T02:32:50Z", "repo": "amantrainvoice", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}], "prs": [{"created_at": "2026-02-25T13:56:37Z", "body_length": 0}, {"created_at": "2026-02-22T07:59:22Z", "body_length": 0}, {"created_at": "2026-02-20T08:29:58Z", "body_length": 0}, {"created_at": "2026-02-20T06:43:16Z", "body_length": 0}, {"created_at": "2026-02-20T03:09:57Z", "body_length": 0}, {"created_at": "2026-02-17T02:38:53Z", "body_length": 155}, {"created_at": "2026-01-05T02:33:58Z", "body_length": 0}, {"created_at": "2026-01-05T02:30:23Z", "body_length": 0}]}